{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>Land</b> — that was adjacent to the river and to the springs in it." "<b>Into salt lands</b> — that it may not be sown and not sprout. He mentioned the cause that HaShem does, for not in vain does He act, for its inhabitants are evil."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 107, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:02.305811376Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}